# Collective Override ({2}{W}{U}): "Choose one. If you control a commander as you cast this spell, you may choose both
# instead. • Create a 1/1 colorless Borg artifact creature token for each attacking creature. • Draw a card for each
# attacking creature." Bot1 has cast Raging Goblin (its commander) and Monastery Swiftspear, both with haste, and
# attacks with both. With a commander on the battlefield the two modes are offered, and each counts the two attackers.

